{"id":"n56257-1-3","stage":0,"title":"미안 · 抱歉","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56257-1-3-1","ko":"미안, 차가 너무 밀려서 늦었어.","zh":"对不起，车太堵了，所以迟到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안,","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","explanation":"미안：抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","readings":[{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56257","senseId":"1","lemma":"미안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차가","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밀려서","meaning":"积压，堆积，拖欠","explanation":"밀리다：积压，堆积，拖欠；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"밀리다","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15786","senseId":"1","lemma":"밀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늦었어.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ba804e5e1f459811","term":"미안","zh":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3","entryId":"56257","definition":"由于做了对不起别人的事而觉得心里不舒坦、感到羞愧。","pronunciation":["미안"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"13748c44ad5107b0","term":"밀리다","zh":"积压，堆积，拖欠","audio":"/audio/13748c44ad5107b043c6.mp3","entryId":"15786","definition":"无法处理的事情或东西被堆积起来。","pronunciation":["밀리다"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]}],"audio":"/audio/0cdbf314767be2f68708.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56257-1-3-2","ko":"넌 항상 지각이잖아.","zh":"你总是迟到啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지각이잖아.","meaning":"迟到","explanation":"지각：迟到；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"지각","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91667","senseId":"1","lemma":"지각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"4415e2551a08952b","term":"지각","zh":"迟到","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3","entryId":"91667","definition":"比规定时间晚上班或上学。","pronunciation":["지각"]}],"audio":"/audio/654d21474f3e69d7d7d6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.613,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56257","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","